      "sourceTextSha256": "12aa472add7ed81fb29f77ea1c3644b17629996b6f74ed9f23da83a4ea16a77a",
      "text": "Day 2 · Guyana’s crown jewel: transfer to Ogle (Eugene F. Correia) airport for a 50-minute flight over pristine rainforest to Kaieteur National Park, home of the Kaieteur Falls, a single drop of about 226 m (741 ft) and one of the most powerful waterfalls in the world. After about two hours at the falls, fly back to Georgetown for a tour of its highlights: the Botanical Gardens, St George’s Cathedral, the Stabroek Market and other heritage sites. In the evening, transfer to the international airport for the flight to Paramaribo, Suriname, where your driver-guide meets you. The order of the Guyana tours may be swapped depending on the Kaieteur flight. (B)",
      "provenance": {
